		<h3 class="mt-5 text-black text-uppercase fw-bold">Why Choose us?</h3>
		<p class="mt-3 mb-5 text-black fw-light fs-5" style="word-spacing: 0.2rem;">We are a <a href="/about">team of passionate professionals</a> with over 5 decades of cumulative experience in the industry, and are all also enthusiastic hobbyist in our own right. We have worked with public aquariums, ensuring our work is as well designed as it can be. We have already made all the mistakes there are to make, so you don't have to make them again
		  <br> <br>
		  No matter big or small, we can take the project on. Not only do we offer maintenence, but also full turn key (from design to production to installation to configuration) services for your tank. Aside from this, we also offer same-day call outs so you can rest assured that we can handle anything that you request from us
		</p>
