		  <div class="row">
		    <h1 class="fw-bolder text-left text-black text-uppercase" >Aquarium Design</h1>    
		  </div>
		  <div class="row mb-5">
		    <div class="col">
		      <p class="text-black fw-light fs-5 mt-3 lh-lg" style="word-spacing: 0.2rem;">
			We believe that every aquarium should reflect the unique tastes and preferences of its owner. Our design process starts with understanding your vision, space, and lifestyle, allowing us to create a customized aquarium that fits perfectly into your environment. From selecting the right fish and plants to designing a functional layout, we tailor every aspect to meet your needs
		      </p>
		    </div>
		    <div class="col">
		      <div class="row">
			<div class="col p-4 pt-5" style="background-color: #000a2d">
			  <h5 class="fw-bolder ms-4">Design process (2-3 weeks): </h5>
			  <ul>
			    <li>Decide the size/dimensions of aquarium</li>
			    <li>Choose a theme/type of aquarium</li>
			    <li>Choose the right equipment for filtration and lighting</li>
			    <li>Draw shop drawings for manufacturing</li>
			    <li>Come up with a maintenence plan</li>
			  </ul>
			</div>
